      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your truck stays parked. Move only the net left and right: keyboard left/right
    keys or your assigned stick. Catch orange small fish for 1 lb and blue tuna for
    5 lb. Missed good fish add the same weight; 20 lb missed eliminates you. Avoid
    the violet SHARK / X poison: catching it eliminates immediately, letting it pass
    is safe. The oval net opening is the catch area. Swimming fish do not home toward
    you. Streams receive the same seeded schedule and warning time. Solo has no score
    or time cap: survive as long as you can and improve your personal best. Multiplayer
    is last survivor; simultaneous final failures produce a draw. Lulls do not erase
    missed weight. Escape / assigned Start pauses every stream, preserving fish and
    score. Reconnect or explicitly replace a source, release controls and freshly
    confirm. Rematches retain names, colors and assignments.'
